      "reason": "The requested regression and cell-by-cell N:P statistics over “all valid cells” require building and applying a common valid-data mask for each comparison so scores are computed only where both fields exist.",
      "status": "not_applicable",
      "not_applicable_reason": "no cell-by-cell model–observation metric, RMSE, bias or shared-mask ranking is requested; maps are for display only and regressions/statistics are computed within each source."
